+Click refers to a parameter in messages by its `spec`, the name it is shown by. For an option, the spec is its longest declaration, so `-t, --times` has the spec `--times`, and `--color/--no-color` has `--color`. For an argument, the spec is its metavar, or its name in upper case, so `filename` has the spec `FILENAME`. The `spec` attribute gives the value, and a subclass of {class}`Parameter` can override it.
